{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STATION TO STATION SURVIVAL</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies close in, endless and relentless. Your energy reserve ticks lower with every desperate move. You grip the controls tighter, heart pounding, wondering if you\u2019ll reach the next station or vanish into the void. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These are the moments that make or break pilots. Will you crack under pressure? Or write your name in the stars?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There\u2019s only one way to find out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111620/extras/74fb8657230243dc09e68a5af0abf8e3.poster.avif?t=1761094606\" width=854 height=364 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111620/extras/74fb8657230243dc09e68a5af0abf8e3.webm?t=1761094606\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111620/extras/74fb8657230243dc09e68a5af0abf8e3.mp4?t=1761094606\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FOR THOSE READY TO TAKE FLIGHT, YOUR MISSION IS SIMPLE:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Make it to the next station.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dock alive.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Score high. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But fall short, and you\u2019ll be joining the space debris.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111620/extras/1c9ccdacf5644c93668dc27a11fe6510.poster.avif?t=1761094606\" width=854 height=364 ><source src=\"